            "agenda_item_number": "6.1",
            "title": "Statement of Investment Policies and Procedures",
            "attachments": [],
            "description": "",
            "minutes": "Todd Saulnier (Senior Investment Consultant and Principal) from the Outsourced Investment Officer firm Mercer, provided a slide presentation on this item and responded to questions from the Board. A copy of the slide presentation is filed with the Board Coordinator.\u00a0\nDaniel Bonder (Principal, Client Service, Mercer) was present.\nThe following staff were also present and responded to questions from the Board:\nThere were no public submissions on this item.\nAction: Mercer agreed to review and assess if section 5.02 of the Statement of Investment Policies and Procedures requires further clarification.\u00a0\nRecommendationThat the Ottawa Investment Board receive the update on the final Statement of Investment Policies and Procedures for information.",
